g_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114140/extras/e8374d0784b4f1e3ad1aacc291aca717.poster.avif?t=1751366639\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114140/extras/e8374d0784b4f1e3ad1aacc291aca717.webm?t=1751366639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114140/extras/e8374d0784b4f1e3ad1aacc291aca717.mp4?t=1751366639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official QQ Discussion Group: 864879210 (How to Unlock What You Want)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Character 1 - Boy: Build up affection, then go on a phone date~ You'll get what you're looking for~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Character 2 - Boy: There are quite a few sisters at home, let's go do something interesting~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Character 3 - Girl: Do what you want to do~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About Us:<br>Hi, we are R.Y.Love\u2642! We aim to create a highly explorable urban life simulation game. Here, you can freely enter different locations, pursue various types of girls, and trigger various events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Introduction:<br>In this game, you play as a boy who just graduated from university. As you step into society, you work hard while developing relationships with girls from various professions. Players can explore more content and unlock exciting storylines by increasing the girls' affection levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Introductions:<br>Housewife<br>Company Receptionist<br>Mall Shopper Girl<br>Convenience Store Sister<br>Library Sister<br>Nurse Sister<br>Lawyer Sister<br>Childhood Friend Fitness Girl<br>Idol Singer Trainee<br>Company's Boss Lady<br>Bad Girls in Prison<br>Female Friends in the Casino<br>And more in the future~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:<br>\u25cf Free map exploration, each building has its own function: your apartment, office building, restaurant, factory, gym, etc.<br>\u25cf 15 girls to pursue, each with 10 storylines. The higher the affection level, the more intimate content you can unlock through dates.<br>\u25cf Each girl has related mini-games that can enhance various abilities, which in turn advance the storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More:<br>This game is in its early version stage, with a game package size of only 1.2G. However, new content will be added monthly, with rich and steamy content. Stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please feel free to speak your mind in this group and express your new expectations for the game. We will do our best to keep improving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other similar games, our game is not limited to steamy content and will definitely bring you a new experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114140/extras/eea15904f23bbae0bb8c0b5d00dd6480.poster.avif?t=1751366639\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114140/extras/eea15904f23bbae0bb8c0b5d00dd6480.webm?t=1751366639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114140/extras/eea15904f23bbae0bb8c0b5d00dd6480.mp4?t=1751366639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114140/extras/1ef542fd439279ef5943227edb7ce37a.poster.avif?t=1751366639\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114140/extras/1ef542fd439279ef5943227edb7ce37a.webm?t=1751366639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114140/extras/1ef542fd439279ef5943227edb7ce37a.mp4?t=1751366639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >casino</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114140/extras/994d69684e4f2ab9472ad90c557a7ab4.poster.avif?t=1751366639\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114140/extras/994d69684e4f2ab9472ad90c557a7ab4.webm?t=1751366639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114140/extras/994d69684e4f2ab9472ad90c557a7ab4.mp4?t=1751366639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\