e Features:<br>\u25cf Free map exploration, each building has its own function: your apartment, office building, restaurant, factory, gym, etc.<br>\u25cf 15 girls to pursue, each with 10 storylines. The higher the affection level, the more intimate content you can unlock through dates.<br>\u25cf Each girl has related mini-games that can enhance various abilities, which in turn advance the storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More:<br>This game is in its early version stage, with a game package size of only 1.2G. However, new content will be added monthly, with rich and steamy content. Stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please feel free to speak your mind in this group and express your new expectations for the game. We will do our best to keep improving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other similar games, our game is not limited to steamy content and will definitely bring you a new experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
